en.use:
Use to assess the stage group for kidney cancer based on the T, N, and M categories. 

The guideline maps the individual TNM components to the overall prognostic stage;

stage I: T1, N0, M0;

stage II: T2, N0, M0;

stage III:T3, N0, M0  OR T1-3, N1, M0;

stage IV: Any T, Any N, M1 OR T4, Any N, M0.
